// Generated by gen.py: cockpit paint colours per car body sprite (main, second), measured offline
// with the same rules as vhr_paint_colours. The matching recoloured driver art ships in the APK as
// vhrpaint_<sprite>.png, so the Quest build never does per-pixel work in GML.
